{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","菲"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名驾驭宝石之力的辅助，擅长为大范围内的友军提供强化。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","好！准备上场啦！"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","All set! I'm ready for my grand entrance."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","更加闪亮了！"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Even shinier!"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","大家，加油！打起精神来！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Come on everyone! Keep your spirits up!"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","梦想……还没有实现……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","My dreams... still unrealized."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","胜利属于大家！"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","Victory belongs to everyone!"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","准备开始辉煌的冒险吧！"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","颜色，火彩，棒极了，你好！"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","这里会不会有宝石呢？成功，太棒了。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","怎么了，这边，不对，那边，不会坏了吧？真是的。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","哇，这是您特意为我准备的吗？好荣幸！！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","居然能收到魔法师送的礼物……好棒！"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/cn","绚彩光舞"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/cn","去探寻比宝石更灿烂的未来吧！"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/cn","绚光星辰"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/cn","魔法是世界上最绚烂的表演！"],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/cn","启程之礼累计登录4天后可领取该皮肤。"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/cn","精英"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","咦？这里有宝石！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","下次考试能通过吗……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","水果芭菲！最大杯！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","啊！星星灯！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","隆冬节快乐呀！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","好漂亮的灯和彩缎！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","快去放烟花吧！"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","菲曾经在十块普通石头里准确无误地选中藏有翡翠的一块。虽然但那块翡翠的尺寸小到完全可以忽略不计的程度……"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","“菲那孩子什么时候才能意识到，她是天生的大明星，魔法和研究真的不适合她。”某位知名的演员经纪人和魔法学院的学员导师都做出过类似的评价。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","魔法学院的预科班曾经举行过一次短跑比赛：比赛学生们的加速魔法水平。菲是唯一一个没能用出这个基础法术的学员，但她凭借身体素质获得了第一。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","冬青学会传说，菲曾经在探险时不小心掉进陷坑里，结果砸出了一条密道——通向一个隐秘的藏宝洞，最终整个队伍满载而归。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","菲喜欢热热闹闹的环境，一旦没人说话就会浑身不自在——或许这就是她没法在图书馆待下去的原因。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","据说菲有一次被盗匪绑架，在被救出来的时候，她已经和隔壁笼子被绑的另一位倒霉蛋聊到了未来的职业规划。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","菲能在一大把人工伪造的宝石中准确地挑出一颗真品，但在魔法学院的入学考试时，却总能完美地避开四个选项里唯一的正确选项。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","据说菲只要坐上一辆公共马车，下车之前，她就能认识包括车夫在内的所有人。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","如果对菲说“你没有魔法天赋，放弃吧”，她只会笑嘻嘻地继续坚持；但如果说“魔法根本没有意义！”她却会立刻火冒三丈。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","菲从来没有祈祷或许过“让我进入魔法学院”之类的愿望，因为她认为那要靠自己努力。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","毛皮……矿石……零件……编织物……唔唔唔唔……"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415015.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","梅瑞特 & 菲"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","咦？这里有宝石！"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415068.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","菲"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","水果芭菲！最大杯！"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415069.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","菲"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","啊！星星灯！"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415373.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","菲"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","隆冬节快乐呀！"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415374.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","菲"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","好漂亮的灯和彩缎！"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415543.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","菲"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","快去放烟花吧！"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415544.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","菲"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","那——么，在闪耀的红宝石之下，打起精神来吧！"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn3/herohub_story/10414030.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","菲 & 维伦 & 漫漫"],["/interaction_records/7/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","遗迹群山"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","准备扎营休息了吗？早知道就给家里捎个信了……"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn3/herohub_story/10414040.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","梅瑞特 & 菲"],["/interaction_records/8/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","遗迹群山"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/cn","漫漫，有喜欢的宝石吗？喜欢哪颗就拿走吧。"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn3/herohub_story/10414090.json"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/cn","菲 & 漫漫"],["/interaction_records/9/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","遗迹群山"],["/interaction_records/10/preview_i18n/cn","我啊，一直都想有些弟弟妹妹……"],["/interaction_records/10/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn3/herohub_story/10414110.json"],["/interaction_records/10/title_i18n/cn","菲 & 梅瑞特"],["/interaction_records/10/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","遗迹群山"],["/interaction_records/11/preview_i18n/cn","特弥希娅，你在喝燕麦粥吗？"],["/interaction_records/11/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn3/herohub_story/10414120.json"],["/interaction_records/11/title_i18n/cn","菲 & 特弥希娅"],["/interaction_records/12/preview_i18n/cn","寻宝需要的是智慧、灵巧和运气，三者缺一不可……"],["/interaction_records/12/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn3/herohub_story/10414160.json"],["/interaction_records/12/title_i18n/cn","阿塔兰忒 & 菲"]]}